{"4288900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUBURBIA INFINITUM", "steam_appid": 4288900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What happened to me?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">&quot;You found your way home.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This doesn't feel like home.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">&quot;Ah, but it will be. It will be more of a home than you have ever had before. And it will be made just for you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288900/extras/08b49af3069c42dfd9810009cfffbd38.avif?t=1767835386\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What will you do with eternity?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a being that has gained awareness after an unknowable amount of being nothing at all, and thrown out into the world to find out who you are. You have a very minimal understanding of the world around you, and must learn everything by speaking to others and learning from them, and form your person in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you has not changed for the past eternity, and will never change. What do you do with an infinite amount of time with no end? What will you do with an infinite amount of things to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor